 ptions\, clips\, export).\n- Honor the 48-hour SLA: no recording sits un
 -started for more than two days.\n- If editing falls more than one episo
 de behind\, publish from buffer and outsource the next first-pass to a f
 reelance Descript editor.\n\nRIGHT LOOKS LIKE\n- Backlog held to <= 1 ep
 isode\; every recording edit-started within 48h\; buffer protected.\n\nA
